  "question": {
    "text": "For adsorption of a gas on a solid, the plot of <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> vs log P is linear with slope equal to (n being whole number)"
